[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5618731769","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123368#issuecomment-5618731769","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123368","id":5618731769,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABTucK-Q","user":{"login":"Alisis33","id":103534710,"node_id":"U_kgDOBivQdg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/103534710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alisis33","html_url":"https://github.com/Alisis33","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alisis33/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alisis33/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alisis33/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alisis33/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alisis33/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alisis33/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alisis33/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alisis33/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alisis33/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-10T12:33:08Z","updated_at":"2026-09-10T12:40:00Z","body":"... I found wrong cased entries here, but casing is correct in the '.tscn'\nIt helps to delete them, but the error returns.\n\n.godot\\editor\\script_editor_cache.cfg\n.godot\\editor\\project_metadata.cfg\n.godot\\editor\\editor_layout.cfg","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5618731769/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5619198355","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123368#issuecomment-5619198355","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123368","id":5619198355,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABTu4pkw","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-10T13:09:25Z","updated_at":"2026-09-10T13:09:25Z","body":"Related:\n* https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99143\n\nSo to clarify: the issue here is that there *isn't* another script in the other path (perhaps due to renames?) and it doesn't clear up the registered entry?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5619198355/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5622792248","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123368#issuecomment-5622792248","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123368","id":5622792248,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABTyUAOA","user":{"login":"Alisis33","id":103534710,"node_id":"U_kgDOBivQdg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/103534710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alisis33","html_url":"https://github.com/Alisis33","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alisis33/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alisis33/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alisis33/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alisis33/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alisis33/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alisis33/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alisis33/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alisis33/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alisis33/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-10T17:31:15Z","updated_at":"2026-09-10T17:31:15Z","body":"> So to clarify: the issue here is that there _isn't_ another script in the other path (perhaps due to renames?) and it doesn't clear up the registered entry?\n\n\n\nYes correct. There is NO actual duplicate declaration, the class only exists once. As shown in the example, the same file is being registered twice with different casing.\n\nAnd yes, it is most likely not limited to this particular error. The duplicate registration and case inconsistency can cause all kinds of errors.\nI was unable to find a duplicate of my bug report, but I think there are several bug reports that are centrally related to this case-handling problem.\n\nAs developers, we often like to lowercase keys for dictionaries and hash tables first in order to avoid duplicates. But this is incorrect when dealing with file paths, because there are operating systems that use case-sensitive file management.\n\nMore importantly, the sanitizing is obviously not consistent throughout the code. Sometimes it is done, sometimes it is not, and this leads to errors.\nThe path case should be sanitized in the file management code as early as possible, before the data is passed deeper into the code. \n\nFor file names and paths, sanitization should use exactly the casing of the real, physically existing files and directories, rather than converting everything to lowercase.\n\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5622792248/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5622840673","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123368#issuecomment-5622840673","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123368","id":5622840673,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABTyW9YQ","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-10T17:35:12Z","updated_at":"2026-09-10T17:35:12Z","body":"> More importantly, the sanitizing is obviously not consistent throughout the code. \n\nWhat is not consistent? We don't ignore casing in the engine and we shouldn't either, unless you have some examples of where it's done? I can't see any reason to believe this is causing any issues here, my suspicion is that this is due to Windows itself and that the paths on the platform were different because Windows doesn't like you to rename paths just changing casing","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5622840673/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5622925262","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123368#issuecomment-5622925262","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123368","id":5622925262,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABTycHzg","user":{"login":"Alisis33","id":103534710,"node_id":"U_kgDOBivQdg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/103534710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alisis33","html_url":"https://github.com/Alisis33","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alisis33/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alisis33/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alisis33/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alisis33/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alisis33/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alisis33/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alisis33/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alisis33/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alisis33